  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "高血压是常见的心血管病,治疗高血压多选用钙离子拮抗剂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "subpart",
      "label": "3-1",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "由苯甲醛、乙酰乙酸乙酯、醋酸铵反应生成的化合物 $\\mathrm{A}(\\mathrm{C_{17}H_{19}NO_4})$ 是一种钙离子拮抗剂,反应式如下。画出A的结构简式。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$$\\mathrm{PhCHO} + 2\\mathrm{CH_3COCH_2CO_2CH_3} + \\mathrm{CH_3CO_2NH_4} \\xrightarrow{\\mathrm{C_2H_5OH}, 80^\\circ\\mathrm{C}} \\mathrm{A}$$"
        }
      ],
      "partId": "part-000153"
    },
    {
      "type": "subpart",
      "label": "3-2",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "上述反应中,如果将醋酸铵转换成羟胺盐酸盐 $(\\mathrm{NH_2OH\\cdot HCl})$,三种物质反应先生成中间体B $(\\mathrm{C_{17}H_{19}NO_5})$,进一步反应生成 $\\mathrm{C}(\\mathrm{C_{17}H_{17}NO_4})$。画出B和C的结构简式。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$$\\mathrm{PhCHO} + 2\\mathrm{CH_3COCH_2CO_2CH_3} + \\mathrm{NH_2OH\\cdot HCl} \\xrightarrow{\\mathrm{C_2H_5OH}, 80^\\circ\\mathrm{C}} \\mathrm{B} \\longrightarrow \\mathrm{C}$$"
        }
      ],
      "partId": "part-000154"
    },
    {
      "type": "subpart",
      "label": "3-3",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "乙酰乙酸乙酯在甲醇钠的存在下与环氧乙烷反应生成D,经溴化氢处理,加热生成E,E在氢化钠的作用下生成甲基环丙基甲酮。画出此转化过程中中间产物D和E的结构简式。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "$$\\mathrm{CH_3COCH_2CO_2CH_3} \\xrightarrow[\\triangle]{\\mathrm{CH_3ONa}, \\mathrm{CH_3OH}} [\\mathrm{D}] \\xrightarrow{\\mathrm{HBr}} [\\mathrm{E}] \\xrightarrow{\\mathrm{NaH}} \\mathrm{H_3C} \\mathrm{O} \\\\ \\uparrow $$"
        }
      ],
      "partId": "part-000155"
    }
  ],
